<div id="urduTextPath">امام علی (ع)/حیدر بخدا عقدہ کشائے دوسرا ہے</div>
<p>warid huwi naagaah shab-e zarbat-e hyder<br />
bas kholte hi roza kamar baandhi ajal par<br />
us shab the kabhi sahen me geh hujre ke andar<br />
ham saaya ko har baar nidaa dete the rokar</p>

<p>hyder ki sawari sooe firdous chali hai<br />
jaago ye shab-e qadr, shab-e qatl-e ali hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wallah mai do raato ka mehmaa'n hu&rsquo;n tumhaara<br />
tar dekhoge kal qoon se resh-e rukh-e zebaa&rsquo;n<br />
barsega lahoo teen din aflaak se har jaa<br />
aye sahebo is saal ali hajj me na hogaa</p>

<p>tum eid ke din ro-oge shabbar se lipat kar<br />
royega hassan baap ke mimbar se lipat kar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kulsum ne rokar kaha wa hasrato darda<br />
kya betiya ab sabr kare aap ko baba<br />
kis tarha yaqee'n tum ko huwa apni ajal ka<br />
farmaya jo irshaad-e payambar hai wo hoga</p>

<p>do roz hai dunya me bas ab kooch hamaara<br />
ek-kisvi(21) ko uthega taaboot hamaara<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>har ghar me sada hoyegi kal haye ali ki<br />
kal roti huwi aayegi yaa rooh nabi ki<br />
haalat mere gham me na bajaa hogi kisi ki<br />
kal aayegi yaa'n laash payambar ke wasi ki</p>

<p>kal shia bhi sar kholenge aur ahle haram bhi<br />
zehra ki sada aayi kafan phaadenge ham bhi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab se rivayat hai ke thi chaar-ghadi raat<br />
mushtaaq-e-qazaa ghar se chale syed-e qush zaat<br />
tasbeeh bakaff jamma huwe deodi pa saadaath<br />
waa'n sheh ne azaa'n di, yaha ki sab ne munajaat</p>

<p>guldasta ho hyder se sar afraaz hamesha<br />
ya rab rahe dunya me ye aawaz hamesha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir baad-e azaa'n kaan me aawaaz ye aayi<br />
aye shiyo ali qatl huwe haq ki duhaayi<br />
is nouhe se aagah huvi saari qudaayi<br />
chehrou pa nabi zaadiyou ne qaak udaayi</p>

<p>jannat se nabi phaad ke daamaan-e kafan aaye<br />
sar peet-te masjid me hussain aur hassan aaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baba ka lahu pehle to chehro'n pa lagaya<br />
phir dono ne ma baine gileem unko uthaya<br />
lekar jo chale rona ali ko bahot aaya<br />
shabbir ne poocha to ye hyder ne sunaya</p>

<p>ronaa ye hai jab halq tu katwaayega pyaare<br />
koi tera laasha na utha-laayega pyaare</p>